#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-SEND-0008 expect=violation domain=DM
#note "PLAN-stopped-rule-engine-fixes item 1, the sensitivity arm: DM.BRTHDTC has no origin at the variable level and only ONE of its two value-level entries (SEX=M) carries one - the SEX=F entry does not. Not every value is documented, so the variable is reported once, never once per record."
#library standard=sendig version=3-1-1
#define-xml CDISC-SEND-0008-vlm-partial-define.xml
#expectViolationCount 1
#expectViolationAt define_variable_name=BRTHDTC
dataset DM
col STUDYID  type=Char
col USUBJID  type=Char
col BRTHDTC  type=Char
col SEX      type=Char
---
S1 | S1-001 | 2024-01-01 | M
S1 | S1-002 | 2024-02-01 | F
